# Flows

This directory contains normative machine-readable product and development flows.

Flow files use IDs of the form:

`[[ spec_prefix ]]-FLOW-NAME`

A flow describes an observable sequence of behavior. It is normative.

Use requirements to describe what must be true.
Use capabilities to group related behavior.
Use flows to describe how behavior proceeds through time.

Do not use flows for exploratory designs. Put those under `project-memory/`.
